          "date": "2026-11-11 01:02:24.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-20531 tests: debug sanityn test_76 open loop stall",
        "message": "LU-20531 tests: debug sanityn test_76 open loop stall\n\nNot for landing.  sanityn test_76 timed out four times on patchset 18\nof https://review.whamcloud.com/67599 (RHEL 9.8 and 10.2, 4 MDTs), with\nthe client looping in ll_layout_refresh(): each layout lock it is\ngranted is cancelled from the LRU before ll_take_md_lock() can match\nit.  It has not reproduced on a single-node setup.\n\nOn top of 67599 patchset 18, test_76 enables dlmtrace and samples the\nMDC namespaces and pools every 30s.  If the open loop makes no progress\nfor 120s, it dumps client and MDS lock state to $LOGDIR, tries\nlru_size=100000 and then lru_size=clear to see whether either ends the\nloop, and fails the test.\n\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanityn\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanityn\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanityn\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanityn\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanityn env=ONLY=76\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanityn env=ONLY=76\nChange-Id: I9a2d487031f95ffc8c91b06a27cfdb4c3504d3d4\nSigned-off-by: Vandana Rungta <vrungta@amazon.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
